<title>BELGIUM: BBL TO CUT INTEREST RATES ON SAVINGS BONDS.</title>
<headline>BBL TO CUT INTEREST RATES ON SAVINGS BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian BBL said on</p>
<p>Friday it would cut interest rates on its bank savings</p>
<p>certificates from Monday.</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    one year	  2.80 pct	3.00</p>
<p>    three years     3.80 pct	4.10</p>
<p>    five years	4.70 pct	5.00</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
